00:39:14.815 --> 00:39:20.438
a journey where every gesture and every word counts to preserve the

00:39:20.438 --> 00:39:22.438
balance.

00:39:22.438 --> 00:39:26.110
The risk of the conflict spreading throughout the Arab world is a serious threat.

00:39:26.110 --> 00:39:28.110
for Europe.

00:39:28.110 --> 00:39:35.049
I have to somehow overcome a certain accusation of being pro-Palestinian.

00:39:35.289 --> 00:39:42.033
I am neither pro-Palestinian nor pro-Israeli;
I must seek peace between those two.

00:39:42.033 --> 00:39:44.033
villages that are fighting over the same land.

00:39:44.033 --> 00:39:47.455
That they respect each other and live in freedom and dignity, each one of them.

00:39:47.515 --> 00:39:52.618
without having to go through this succession of violence, and if we don't succeed...

00:39:53.850 --> 00:40:00.295
Well, the spiral of hatred will continue to grow, and we'll go from funeral to funeral and

00:40:00.295 --> 00:40:00.795
of

00:40:00.915 --> 00:40:04.217
deaths upon deaths in knowing when this
can be stopped.

00:40:05.538 --> 00:40:10.702
The high-ranking representative, accompanied by the Israeli Minister for the United Nations,

00:40:10.702 --> 00:40:12.702
Eli Cohen,

00:40:12.702 --> 00:40:13.344
Visit one of the kibitzum on attack.

00:40:13.484 --> 00:40:19.768
There is only one party responsible for this
atrocity, and that is Hamas.

00:40:20.889 --> 00:40:21.589
They are not human.

00:40:22.358 --> 00:40:28.943
We are monsters and we should all be united to liberate Gaza from Hamas.

00:40:30.104 --> 00:40:31.986
for the security of the State of Israel.

00:40:33.106 --> 00:40:37.389
For the people of Gaza and for the whole world.

00:40:37.390 --> 00:40:42.191
If not, Europe will be next.

00:40:42.251 --> 00:40:43.592
Thank you so much.

00:40:44.552 --> 00:40:51.135
Minister, allow me to say something that doesn't come from this document, but from the part

00:40:51.135 --> 00:40:53.135
lower part of my heart.

00:40:53.135 --> 00:40:55.258
I understand your fears and your pain.

00:40:56.346 --> 00:41:01.091
I understand the fears and pain of the
people who have been attacked, killed,

00:41:01.211 --> 00:41:03.794
murdered.

00:41:03.854 --> 00:41:06.397
I understand your laughter.

00:41:08.898 --> 00:41:13.161
But let me ask you not to be
consumed by rage.

00:41:13.162 --> 00:41:15.462
That's what Israel's best friend
can tell you.

00:41:15.582 --> 00:41:22.286
Because what makes the difference between a civilized society and a group

00:41:22.287 --> 00:41:26.488
Terrorism is the lack of respect for human life.

00:41:26.489 --> 00:41:30.010
We cannot bring life to death,

00:41:30.090 --> 00:41:34.793
But we can give freedom to the hostile.

00:41:36.474 --> 00:41:42.079
On the same day, a meeting is held with
the families of the hosts killed by

00:41:42.079 --> 00:41:42.579
Hamas.

00:41:42.680 --> 00:41:46.203
Imagine, someone you love, just one person.

00:41:46.243 --> 00:41:52.870
It can be your son, your daughter, your grandmother, your
wife, your husband, just one.

00:41:53.450 --> 00:41:59.757
But imagine this: shooting, recording in different languages,

00:41:59.817 --> 00:42:05.123
RPG for your children, for your love that
you think about now.

00:42:05.724 --> 00:42:06.765
Imagine that.

00:42:09.609 --> 00:42:10.850
Please.

00:42:13.910 --> 00:42:16.833
It's a screenshot from a propaganda video
that Hamas published.

00:42:16.893 --> 00:42:21.838
We saw my brother scared, humiliated,

00:42:22.539 --> 00:42:23.900
heading.

00:42:23.901 --> 00:42:30.867
It's crazy that we're grateful to
see him like this, in a video, alive.

00:42:30.868 --> 00:42:34.190
And that's how we want to receive it again.

00:42:35.838 --> 00:42:39.720
We don't have time to die over the dead.

00:42:39.860 --> 00:42:43.201
because we just want them to go back home.

00:42:43.202 --> 00:42:46.243
It's unforgettable, so I'm really asking that, you know,

00:42:46.603 --> 00:42:51.585
We just need an agreement, and we know that
there can be one.

00:42:53.566 --> 00:42:57.088
I never felt more powerful than at that moment.

00:42:57.228 --> 00:42:58.749
To have the ability to...

00:42:58.750 --> 00:42:59.450
...of...

00:43:10.382 --> 00:43:12.203
I want to ask you something.

00:43:12.243 --> 00:43:16.887
I believe Qataris are the main
countries influencing Hamas.

00:43:16.907 --> 00:43:23.231
There's the money budget, the
humanitarian budget, and if Qatar says to

00:43:23.231 --> 00:43:23.551
Sinoa,

00:43:23.551 --> 00:43:28.735
This murderous man, stop him now,
keep them all out,

00:43:28.775 --> 00:43:31.517
They can do it.

00:43:32.518 --> 00:43:35.825
Your pressure is not simple in Qatar,

00:43:36.145 --> 00:43:42.618
But Qatar needs its reputation in the Arab world, and they need its reputation in

00:43:42.618 --> 00:43:44.618
Europe.

00:43:44.618 --> 00:43:46.618
And Europe, that's you.

00:43:47.866 --> 00:43:54.651
I feel devastated when I walk into school, and you think about the children there.

00:43:54.651 --> 00:43:56.651
there were

00:43:56.651 --> 00:43:58.651
murdered.

00:43:58.651 --> 00:44:02.597
But of course, five kilometers away
they're bombing Gaza and they're also

00:44:02.597 --> 00:44:04.597
dying

00:44:04.597 --> 00:44:05.119
Every day children under the bombs.

00:44:06.199 --> 00:44:09.221
Therefore, one horror does not justify another.

00:44:12.346 --> 00:44:16.154
I come from a part of the world, from the
European Union,

00:44:16.214 --> 00:44:22.025
that for years we have been fighting
against terror, devastating, killing,

00:44:22.165 --> 00:44:24.550
almost committing suicide.

00:44:24.670 --> 00:44:27.212
And in the end we make reconciliation.

00:44:27.213 --> 00:44:32.415
And today you can travel from Gibraltar to the Arctic without crossing any borders.

00:44:33.636 --> 00:44:35.277
The border, Mr. President,

00:44:35.278 --> 00:44:41.061
It is the burden that history has been
carrying on the Earth's framework.

00:44:41.062 --> 00:44:43.643
And we have to overcome it.

00:44:43.644 --> 00:44:49.387
And we have to do this, not only between
Israel and the Arab countries,

00:44:49.487 --> 00:44:52.549
but between Israel and Palestine.

00:44:55.430 --> 00:44:56.130
Good morning, friends.

00:44:56.130 --> 00:45:00.732
We are very happy to have a representative with us this morning.

00:45:00.752 --> 00:45:02.892
He really wanted to come and pay a quick visit to the EU delegations.

00:45:02.893 --> 00:45:03.593
The Union

00:45:04.233 --> 00:45:11.214
The European Union currently has 145 delegations
throughout the

00:45:11.615 --> 00:45:18.416
world that carry out diplomatic activities and work with the association

00:45:18.416 --> 00:45:20.416
