European embassies.

00:45:20.416 --> 00:45:24.218
In the Jerusalem delegation, the tension
of the conflict is palpable.

00:45:24.854 --> 00:45:31.384
We have many Christians here, among the
colleagues, who would like to say, tension,

00:45:31.384 --> 00:45:33.384
You can feel it if you walk through the old city,

00:45:33.384 --> 00:45:35.384
The tension is very high.

00:45:35.384 --> 00:45:38.253
If you are Palestinian, you will be arrested by the IDF police.

00:45:38.313 --> 00:45:42.458
Especially at night, there's a tension
out there.

00:45:42.578 --> 00:45:47.921
Palestinian support has been reduced to humanitarian needs.

00:45:47.981 --> 00:45:51.843
Instead of focusing on what we need, it's the international lawyer.

00:45:51.903 --> 00:45:52.603
Nothing else.

00:45:52.603 --> 00:45:54.685
We want to talk to you more.

00:45:54.686 --> 00:45:55.545
It's a very short time.

00:45:55.546 --> 00:45:58.087
We can accompany you in our homes.

00:45:58.187 --> 00:45:59.047
Shirin, please.

00:45:59.407 --> 00:46:00.488
But he wants to hear from us.

00:46:00.489 --> 00:46:01.368
But he has a plan.

00:46:01.369 --> 00:46:02.429
He has to go to Ramallah.

00:46:02.449 --> 00:46:03.149
Please, Shirin.

