The most complicated step is the meeting with
the main NGOs at the Bank of

00:46:20.225 --> 00:46:26.350
West. The tension caused by the struggles
of the Palestinian population with the

00:46:26.350 --> 00:46:28.350
inhabitants and the Israeli army, and, above all,

00:46:28.350 --> 00:46:30.934
due to the increased bombing of Gaza, it is
extremely high.

00:46:32.730 --> 00:46:38.534
Every four minutes now a Palestinian is killed, and every ten minutes a child is killed.

00:46:38.534 --> 00:46:38.774
killed.

00:46:38.774 --> 00:46:43.437
We're all talking about what comes next,
we need to talk about what's happening now

00:46:43.437 --> 00:46:45.437
now.

00:46:45.437 --> 00:46:47.640
We have a right to the jungle, not to the
international.

00:46:47.700 --> 00:46:50.443
And that has to stop.

00:46:50.483 --> 00:46:54.487
Another thing that worries us a lot is the
level of the double standard.

00:46:54.527 --> 00:47:01.033
Why in the case of Ukraine is all this support going to Ukraine because it is

00:47:01.033 --> 00:47:03.033
