00:47:03.033 --> 00:47:07.159
occupation, and in our case, the support goes to
the occupiers, not the employed?

00:47:07.160 --> 00:47:08.520
I understand your frustration.

00:47:10.618 --> 00:47:13.520
And I understand there are two decisions regarding
this.

00:47:13.540 --> 00:47:20.264
When I have to bring the resolution to the 27th
and I need unanimity, I have to compose.

00:47:20.265 --> 00:47:25.188
We have been fighting for two states
for more than three decades.

00:47:25.189 --> 00:47:25.889
And nothing has been done.

00:47:25.889 --> 00:47:29.072
negotiations, procrastination,
coercion, diplomacy.

00:47:29.073 --> 00:47:31.735
You don't want to recognize the Palestinian state.

00:47:31.736 --> 00:47:33.037
I hear you, but I don't remember you.

00:47:33.578 --> 00:47:39.204
But if you want to be practical, please
call on Israel to end the occupation

00:47:39.204 --> 00:47:41.204
Israeli military.

00:47:41.204 --> 00:47:43.204
But not because of my rhetoric.

00:47:43.204 --> 00:47:44.049
Because I love your rhetoric, I really do,
