00:47:51.253 --> 00:47:53.116
grabbing the map from the sea to the
sea and then falling silent.

00:47:53.136 --> 00:47:54.958
They have to stop the atrocity.

00:47:54.959 --> 00:47:59.721
The crime of collective punishment, the crime of ethnic cleansing, and the crime

00:47:59.721 --> 00:48:03.284
of the
violence.

00:48:03.285 --> 00:48:04.165
Yes, but, you know what?

00:48:04.166 --> 00:48:10.350
It makes us very frustrated and short on resources, because
you have a meeting that's only an hour and a half long,

00:48:10.350 --> 00:48:12.350
Once it's over, I don't have time to
