00:48:12.350 --> 00:48:17.098
This issue of the right to self-determination
for the Palestinian people

00:48:17.138 --> 00:48:18.159
will maintain.

00:48:18.339 --> 00:48:22.423
That's what we have to do.

00:48:22.664 --> 00:48:29.571
But now we need to try to find
concrete things we can do to

00:48:29.571 --> 00:48:31.571
get out of this

00:48:31.571 --> 00:48:33.571
