00:48:41.803 --> 00:48:42.424
treaties that have been made but have not been maintained.

00:48:42.444 --> 00:48:48.529
And we have seen that the occupation is becoming more entrenched with more settlements,

00:48:48.589 --> 00:48:49.970
more land confiscation,

00:48:49.971 --> 00:48:56.934
More home demolitions and more pronounced Israeli policy that undermines the

00:48:56.935 --> 00:49:01.878
