reduction and inequality.

00:49:03.562 --> 00:49:09.566
In the absence of military power, the EU
exerts its diplomatic influence through

00:49:09.566 --> 00:49:11.566
of their economic power.

00:49:11.566 --> 00:49:14.950
It is the main financier of the Palestinian National Authority.

00:49:14.951 --> 00:49:17.632
as it should be in the reconstruction of
Gaza when the war is over.

00:49:17.633 --> 00:49:23.936
The delegation of high-ranking representatives
now faces the final leg of the journey,

00:49:23.936 --> 00:49:25.936
