00:49:34.941 --> 00:49:37.964
The possibility of securing a pair of briefs in Gaza will mark the success of their mission to

00:49:37.964 --> 00:49:41.065
the Middle
East.

00:49:41.145 --> 00:49:47.067
Mr. Prime Minister, I am sure that
you will do everything you can to free

00:49:47.067 --> 00:49:49.067
These hostile ones.

00:49:49.067 --> 00:49:51.888
For our part, the European Union is
doing exactly the same thing.

00:49:51.948 --> 00:49:56.590
putting pressure on both sides to
make this agreement possible.

00:49:56.898 --> 00:50:03.743
We are close to reaching an agreement that
can

00:50:03.823 --> 00:50:06.665
take people home,

00:50:07.445 --> 00:50:11.808
whether it's the Hamas hosts or any other exchange that might occur.

00:50:32.446 --> 00:50:37.370
Important things that shouldn't be relevant to the agreement itself, but if the

00:50:37.370 --> 00:50:39.370
The agreement will make it easier,

00:50:39.370 --> 00:50:39.892
We hope it happens as soon as possible.

00:50:39.932 --> 00:50:43.975
Qatar and the European Union see a humanitarian pause very close to Gaza.

00:50:44.075 --> 00:50:50.481
Hamas and Israel join forces to exchange 50
hostiles in exchange for 150 prisoners

00:50:50.481 --> 00:50:52.481
Palestinians.

00:50:53.270 --> 00:50:58.171
Burel and his team returned to Brussels
to explain the agreement with the Union

00:50:58.171 --> 00:51:00.171
European 27.

00:51:00.171 --> 00:51:02.693
The European Union is a structure that
is always based on a fragile balance.

00:51:02.753 --> 00:51:08.174
A Europe that seems to function better on the front lines of threats, such as Brexit,

00:51:08.414 --> 00:51:09.915
the pandemic or Ukraine.

00:51:09.916 --> 00:51:15.576
A Europe that perhaps still finds it
too difficult to explain to its

00:51:15.576 --> 00:51:17.576
citizens.

00:51:22.278 --> 00:51:25.199
Everything depends on the ability to react
to the crisis.

00:51:25.839 --> 00:51:32.042
But anticipating a crisis and acting
with the expectation that something might happen,

00:51:33.262 --> 00:51:37.724
That proactive attitude; we are much more
reactive.

00:51:37.784 --> 00:51:40.405
Therefore, we will be what the world forces us to be.

00:51:43.098 --> 00:51:46.921
The United States Congress
unlocks $61 million in aid

00:51:46.921 --> 00:51:48.921
for Ukraine.

00:51:48.921 --> 00:51:49.024
Israel has been attacked by 170
large...

00:51:49.024 --> 00:51:50.544
The victims of the attack on Damascus...

00:51:50.545 --> 00:51:54.067
Geopolitical crises are advancing at a frenetic pace.

00:51:54.087 --> 00:52:00.832
The question is whether a future union of 600 million people, with its enormous

00:52:00.832 --> 00:52:02.832
organizational complexity,

00:52:02.832 --> 00:52:07.078
a Europe that is still caught up in
nation-states, that finds it difficult to

00:52:07.078 --> 00:52:07.258
serenity,

00:52:07.258 --> 00:52:11.922
will have the tools to deal with the
new multipolar and globalized world.

00:52:12.538 --> 00:52:16.120
I don't know if history will accelerate or reverse.

00:52:17.121 --> 00:52:23.465
What I do know is that the founding fathers
surely didn't imagine that the Europe that

00:52:23.465 --> 00:52:25.465
