00:52:25.465 --> 00:52:26.066
was to go as far as it has gone.

00:52:34.894 --> 00:52:41.078
Everyone is going to Tel Aviv, asking them not to do it; they are protecting civilians.

00:52:41.079 --> 00:52:42.979
Don't kill so many.

00:52:43.039 --> 00:52:45.440
How many is that?

00:52:45.441 --> 00:52:46.180
What is the standard?

00:52:48.682 --> 00:52:49.762
But Netanyahu doesn't listen to anyone.

00:52:49.763 --> 00:52:51.923
They are going to be evacuated.

00:52:51.944 --> 00:52:53.364
Where?

00:52:53.424 --> 00:52:54.124
By Monday?

00:52:54.124 --> 00:52:59.508
Well, if you think so many people are being killed,

00:52:59.608 --> 00:53:02.950
Perhaps you should offer fewer weapons.

00:53:04.190 --> 00:53:09.447
In short, to prevent so many people from being murdered, it's not logical.

